      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is actually a rare and dangerous kind of peace to embrace the end of a struggle so completely.\n\nThe \"honest\" acceptance you feel can be the quiet suicide of a life that has no more reason to be lived.\n\nYou are not just \"stopping\"; you are choosing to end the attempt to find yourself by the same broken method you used to succeed.",
